---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site-config";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="sr-only">
      Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}, [TU CARGO AQUÍ] from {SITE.location.countryName}. My primary
      tools of choice includes: [TU TECNOLOGÍA], [TU TECNOLOGÍA], [TU TECNOLOGÍA].
      I also have knowledge of [TUS CONOCIMIENTOS AQUÍ]. Beyond coding, [CUENTA MÁS SOBRE TI AQUÍ].
      While I have some preferred tools, I always choose the best one for the
      job, even if it's not on my usual list. My goal is to find the right
      solution for each project.
    </p>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="text-sm font-light">
      <p class="text-sm font-light">
        Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}, [TU CARGO AQUÍ] from {SITE.location.countryName}.
      </p>
      <br />
      My primary tools of choice includes:
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>[TU TECNOLOGÍA]</li>
        <li>[TU TECNOLOGÍA]</li>
        <li>[TU TECNOLOGÍA]</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm font-light mt-2">
        I also have knowledge of [TUS CONOCIMIENTOS AQUÍ].
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      [CUENTA MÁS SOBRE TI AQUÍ]
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
